{"id":"B1-L020","title":"Verb pattern: ask someone to do — form","cefr":"B1","level":"B1","unit":"B1-U02","focus":"ask someone to do — forma","targets":{"grammar":"ask someone to do — forma","pron":"Sentence stress","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":["The thing is…"],"words":["help desk","teacher support","shy learner","peer help","break reminder","open door","learning gap","extra lesson","speaking up","school culture","asking for help","teacher’s request","class agreement","raised question","study partner","helpful tip","learning support","support teacher"],"field":"Educação","genre":"Editorial / opinião","skill":"Escuta","words_min":18},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 20 · Verb pattern: ask someone to do — form","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** ask someone to do — forma.","**Expressões:** The thing is….","**Pronúncia:** Sentence stress.","**18 palavras novas** (educação).","**Texto do dia:** editorial / opinião."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (B1):** eu consigo pedir que alguém faça algo (ask, tell, allow, remind + objeto + to) e opinar com The thing is…"},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["","Esta aula treina **ouvir e anotar informações (IELTS Listening, TOEFL Listening)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["help desk","balcão de ajuda"],["teacher support","apoio do professor"],["shy learner","aluno tímido"],["peer help","ajuda entre colegas"],["break reminder","lembrete de pausa"],["open door","porta aberta"],["learning gap","lacuna de aprendizagem"],["extra lesson","aula extra"],["speaking up","ter voz ativa"],["school culture","cultura escolar"],["asking for help","pedir ajuda"],["teacher’s request","teacher’s request"],["class agreement","class agreement"],["raised question","raised question"],["study partner","study partner"],["helpful tip","helpful tip"],["learning support","learning support"],["support teacher","support teacher"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An editorial","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Let Students Ask for Help","paras":["Teachers often **ask students to work** alone. **The thing is…** many students are afraid to ask for help. Schools should **allow them to use** study groups and **remind them to take** breaks.","We should **encourage students to speak up**, not **tell them to be quiet**."],"kicker":"OPINION","by":"Education Weekly","gloss":[]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Teachers often ask students to work alone.","ans":"T","why":"work alone."},{"q":"Many students love to ask for help.","ans":"F","why":"afraid."},{"q":"The writer wants to tell students to be quiet.","ans":"F","why":"not tell."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“encourage” = ?","opts":["incentivar","encurralar","encerrar"],"ans":0,"why":"encourage."},{"q":"“remind” = ?","opts":["lembrar alguém","remover","relembrar só"],"ans":0,"why":"remind."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"ask / tell / allow / remind + objeto + to","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Verbo","Exemplo"],"rows":[["ask","**I asked him to wait.**"],["tell","**She told us to sit.**"],["allow","**They allow us to use phones.**"],["remind","**Remind me to call.**"],["encourage","**We encourage them to speak.**"]],"cap":"ask / tell / allow / remind + objeto + to"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Negativa: **not to** antes do verbo: *She told us not to run.*"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"Teachers ask students ___ work alone. (to)","a":"to","why":"ask + obj + to."},{"s":"Remind me ___ call her. (to)","a":"to","why":"remind."},{"s":"She told us ___ to run. (not)","a":"not","why":"not to."},{"s":"They allow us ___ use groups. (to)","a":"to","why":"allow."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["study group","grupo de estudo"],["group work","trabalho em grupo"],["help desk","balcão de ajuda"],["teacher support","apoio do professor"],["class rule","regra da sala"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["remind","you","to","come","I'll"],"ans":"I'll remind you to come","pt":"Lembro você de vir."},{"words":["me","Can","I","ask","you","to","help"],"ans":"Can I ask you to help me","pt":"Posso pedir que me ajude?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"help desk","pos":"word","pt":"balcão de ajuda","ex":"Help desk.","expt":"Balcão de ajuda."},{"w":"teacher support","pos":"word","pt":"apoio do professor","ex":"Teacher support.","expt":"Apoio do professor."},{"w":"shy learner","pos":"word","pt":"aluno tímido","ex":"Shy learner.","expt":"Aluno tímido."},{"w":"peer help","pos":"word","pt":"ajuda entre colegas","ex":"Peer help.","expt":"Ajuda entre colegas."},{"w":"break reminder","pos":"word","pt":"lembrete de pausa","ex":"Break reminder.","expt":"Lembrete de pausa."},{"w":"open door","pos":"word","pt":"porta aberta","ex":"Open door.","expt":"Porta aberta."},{"w":"learning gap","pos":"word","pt":"lacuna de aprendizagem","ex":"Learning gap.","expt":"Lacuna de aprendizagem."},{"w":"extra lesson","pos":"word","pt":"aula extra","ex":"Extra lesson.","expt":"Aula extra."},{"w":"speaking up","pos":"word","pt":"ter voz ativa","ex":"Speaking up.","expt":"Ter voz ativa."},{"w":"school culture","pos":"word","pt":"cultura escolar","ex":"School culture.","expt":"Cultura escolar."},{"w":"asking for help","pos":"word","pt":"pedir ajuda","ex":"Asking for help.","expt":"Pedir ajuda."},{"w":"teacher’s request","pos":"word","pt":"teacher’s request","ex":"pedido do professor","expt":"Teacher’s request."},{"w":"class agreement","pos":"word","pt":"class agreement","ex":"acordo da turma","expt":"Class agreement."},{"w":"raised question","pos":"word","pt":"raised question","ex":"pergunta levantada","expt":"Raised question."},{"w":"study partner","pos":"word","pt":"study partner","ex":"colega de estudo","expt":"Study partner."},{"w":"helpful tip","pos":"word","pt":"helpful tip","ex":"dica útil","expt":"Helpful tip."},{"w":"learning support","pos":"word","pt":"learning support","ex":"apoio à aprendizagem","expt":"Learning support."},{"w":"support teacher","pos":"word","pt":"support teacher","ex":"professor de apoio","expt":"Support teacher."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**The thing is…** — O problema é que…","**Speak your mind.** — Diga o que pensa.","**Don’t hesitate to ask.** — Não hesite em perguntar.","**Can I ask you to help me?** — Posso pedir que me ajude?","**I will. Please remind me.** — Vou. Por favor, me lembre.","**I’ll remind you to come.** — Lembro você de vir.","**At first sight.** — À primeira vista.","**At your service.** — Às suas ordens."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"discuss","pt":"discutir (um tema)","forms":[["I / you / we / they discuss","We discuss plans."],["he / she / it discusses","She discusses it."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"In the corridor","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"In the corridor","lines":[["Student","Can I ask you to help me?","Posso pedir que me ajude?"],["Teacher","Of course. The thing is, I need you to ask earlier.","Claro. O problema é que preciso que pergunte antes."],["Student","I will. Please remind me.","Vou. Por favor, me lembre."],["Teacher","I’ll remind you to come.","Lembro você de vir."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Sentence stress","items":[{"label":"Sentence stress","note":"Na frase, acentue palavras de conteúdo (substantivos, verbos, adjetivos) e reduza as funcionais: I WANT to LEARN ENglish.","words":["I want to learn English.","She has studied for years.","Can you help me?"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Ask someone to do something.","pt":"Peça.","model":"Can I ask you to help me?"},{"q":"Tell someone not to do it.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I told him not to run."},{"q":"Start with The thing is…","pt":"Comece.","model":"The thing is, I have no time."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with ask / tell / allow / remind + to.","model":"Teachers ask students to work alone. They told us to be quiet. The school allows us to use phones. Remind me to call her. The thing is, many students are afraid to ask.","checklist":["Usei **obj + to**","Usei **4 verbos**","Usei **The thing is…**"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “study group” mean?","opts":["trabalho em grupo","grupo de estudo","apoio do professor"],"ans":1,"why":"**study group** = grupo de estudo."},{"q":"What does “group work” mean?","opts":["balcão de ajuda","regra da sala","trabalho em grupo"],"ans":2,"why":"**group work** = trabalho em grupo."},{"q":"What does “help desk” mean?","opts":["balcão de ajuda","apoio do professor","hora do silêncio"],"ans":0,"why":"**help desk** = balcão de ajuda."},{"q":"What does “teacher support” mean?","opts":["regra da sala","apoio do professor","política da escola"],"ans":1,"why":"**teacher support** = apoio do professor."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}